                "message": "✨ Add sp-fetch-inbox: file inbox articles with a BibTeX entry beside the PDF\n\n- sp-fetch-inbox picks an article from the DEVONthink inbox group or ~/Documents/literature/inbox\n- finds the DOI in the PDF, fetches the entry, asks for the .bib file\n- shows the PDF and an editable BibTeX buffer side by side\n- on confirmation moves the PDF to literature as KEY.pdf, updates DEVONthink, appends the entry\n- sp-devonthink-record-note no longer fails with \"No BibTeX entry\" on a record that is not a citekey yet\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi8mSFguF5ghQjmfQgM",
